    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεισ-κυκλέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roll</i> or <i>bring in one upon another,</i> 'pile
